Package: findIMPACT
Type: Package
Title: Fuzzy File Finder for the IMPACT NCI R01 Project Folder
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("IMPACT NCI R01", "Study Team", email = "you@pitt.edu", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Search the IMPACT NCI R01 project folder for files using loose,
    fuzzy keywords instead of hardcoded filenames or paths (e.g. "MA_contracts"
    finds a path containing "MA_ctrct"). Also previews matched files (size,
    last modified date, and - for common tabular formats - column names and
    the first few rows) so you can confirm you found the right file before
    opening it. Works the same way for every team member regardless of their
    computer or local OneDrive path, since the project root is auto-detected
    rather than hardcoded.
